  "limits": [
    "Pool Panic Endless is reworked as a native pool-defense conveyor. Original persistent shooters, Tall-nuts, Torchwood, Spikeweed and Lily Pads combine with occasional emergency instant plants. Inventory-aware weighted deliveries respect actual native entry space; the original shovel supports rebuilding. Health-paced waves, native flag warnings and clear announcements, saved supply RNG, automatic boundary checkpoints and a compact best stamp preserve a developing lawn and readable interface. Earlier minigames, accepted artwork, original mode IDs, unlock rules and serialized object layouts are preserved. Full original parity remains unverified.",
    "Focused production-method tests and build checks do not replace broad game or browser validation.",
    "Earlier results remain historical parent evidence only. No separately image-generated challenge illustrations are active."
  ]
